# Gem Store Listings API

The Gem Store Listings API provides marketplace operations for gemstone listings.

## Base Gateway URL

https://localhost:8243/gemstore/1.0.0

## Authentication

Protected endpoints require a Gem Store JWT:

Authorization: Bearer <JWT>

The JWT is validated by the Spring Boot backend after being forwarded through WSO2 API Manager.

## Public Endpoints

GET /api/v1/listings

GET /api/v1/listings/{id}

GET /api/v1/listings/{id}/detail

GET /api/v1/listings/search

GET /api/v1/listings/seller/{sellerId}

GET /api/v1/listings/public/{slug}

## Protected Endpoints

POST /api/v1/listings

GET /api/v1/listings/my

PUT /api/v1/listings/{id}

PATCH /api/v1/listings/{id}

DELETE /api/v1/listings/{id}

POST /api/v1/listings/upload

POST /api/v1/listings/{id}/sold

POST /api/v1/listings/{id}/archive

POST /api/v1/listings/{id}/reactivate

## Pagination

List endpoints support:

page
size

Example:

GET /api/v1/listings?page=0&size=20

## Search

Example:

GET /api/v1/listings/search?query=sapphire&minPrice=1000&maxPrice=500000

## Image Upload

POST /api/v1/listings/upload

Content-Type:
multipart/form-data

Field:
file

The request must include:

Authorization: Bearer <JWT>

## Common Responses

200 OK

201 Created

400 Bad Request

401 Unauthorized

403 Forbidden

404 Not Found

409 Conflict

429 Too Many Requests

500 Internal Server Error